{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20268sve72f24L1794199822.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產馬鞍山迎海御峰分行資深區域營業經理胡耀祖表示，近日不少向隅客陸續回流二手市場，西沙Sierra sea最新錄2A期2座高層G室，實用面積454平方呎，2房間隔，開價約700萬元，議價後以680萬元易手，實用平均呎價14,978元。</p><p><br/>中原胡耀祖指，新買家為一手向隅客，見單位間隔合用，價錢合理，即決定入市單位自用。據了解，原業主於2026年2月以516萬元購入單位，持貨約9個月，是次轉手賬面上獲利164萬元或31.8%離場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.265178+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":216,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T07:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T12:57:13.209066+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:43.561479+00:00","content_hash":"1c0199a6e177cbbbfc3175d6a4b6b671902c665c8468efbb57e3e6d3dbfcac72","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}